===Noun===
{{en-noun|~|+|cortices}}

# {{lb|en|countable|anatomy}} The outer layer of an internal organ or body structure, such as the [[kidney]] or the [[brain]].
# {{lb|en|uncountable|botany}} The [[tissue]] of a [[stem]] or [[root]] that lies inward from the [[epidermis]], but exterior to the [[vascular]] tissue.
# {{lb|en|archaeology}} The outer surface of a piece of [[flint]].

